Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.79,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I can't tell what'll come tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:49.21,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}This is different than making a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:50.92,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Something about it is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.92,0:01:54.55,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}And I don't think of it as some sort of forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:57.76,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}So I just don't get why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:01.22,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I can't quite wrap my head around it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:07.23,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)\fscx90}but your existence is now much more than just important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:13.19,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}There's nothing in this world that doesn't come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:17.53,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I don't cry because I'm hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:20.20,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}They're the sweet, sweet drops of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:23.74,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I want to go on dreaming forever, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:27.16,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I want to try and be more gentle, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:30.58,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}If I can be with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:34.00,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Girls are really strong, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:37.42,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}But sometimes, they can be really weak, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:43.72,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Our wishes are happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:47.68,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}And our days will be just as happy!
