Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:42.74,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H595E5D&\frz18.048\fnEdo SZ\fs48\fsp10\pos(637,480)}Kaga Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go and pick out some bread and drinks for breakfast tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't listen to a word people say...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm... What do we need for a cold? Water, sports drinks...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dairy products and the like...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe some food that's easy on the stomach...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.05,0:00:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Should we buy something for you to have for breakfast, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cereal or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.05,0:00:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did she catch it from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There are cold germs floating around all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes people catch it, and sometimes they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point worrying about who caught what from whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I pick something to take with us when we go to see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Put it in the basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you doing in the sweets aisle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki! I told you to get something for breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is my place!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We probably shouldn't go in, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll just be an extra worry for your mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The food's in here, so you can give it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.31,0:03:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum! Daikichi brought us food!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to what people say, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much. You've done so much for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I should be thanking you after all you did for Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:03:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She went back to school today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening. It's good that you're all better, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm cooking up some of that rice porridge right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so I'll be better in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.15,0:04:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Let's go throw my tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nitani-san, you might have caught\Nthis because you watched over Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.46,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll throw it from here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I come into contact with countless people each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.50,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,We're so high up...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:39.42,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to throw it onto that roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Every day I ride a packed train to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no guarantee it came from her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least let me help with Kouki,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,even if it's just picking him up and bringing him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:05:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, we're going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.45,0:05:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let's play video games!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure thing, next time I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki... Make sure and help your mum, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The pudding and the smaller drink are from Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pudding is my favourite!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you up so early? It's Sunday!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I already told you! We're practising for the skipping competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's wobbly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Brush slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop wiggling it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.03,0:06:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't be pushing yourself so hard yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no. I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for always taking advantage of your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think {\i1}I'm{\i0} the one who should be saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised Kouki's having such trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He just can't seem to get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you're jumping too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:07:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The jump rope whirls around like this, so you should be jumping here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.56,0:07:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So why are you moving your legs and arms at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your move your arms first, and then your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First, try it slowly once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Me, too! Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your problem is that you're swinging\Nyour arms in circles that are too big, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep your arms in like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're early!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't see why they're so fired up...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobu-kun's really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's because he has a big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He has someone to learn everything from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want to join in, Sayaka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She just lost one of her upper teeth, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard being a girl, huh? Even as a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.03,0:08:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan... What sort of container do you hold your teeth in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did your parents get you a cute one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you know? There are cases that you can\Nput your kid's old baby teeth in as a memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A memento?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They have these tiny cute ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:11.42,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:12.47,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Mine's a butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:19.89,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,I bought one for Kouki, too, but he doesn't save his teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin would love one of those!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm an idiot! I should've known there'd be something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since I've met Rin, every day's been like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,freaking out and fussing over the tiniest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.07,0:08:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, this is for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I drew it in school!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I had to write about a member of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.83,0:08:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You put your baby teeth in it when they fall out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As a little keepsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A keepsake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kouki-kun's mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:08:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:09:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't that Kouki's?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. It's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I throw mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've thrown all of mine on the roof until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can throw them or keep them. It's up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin. I'm going to give skipping my all next time, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're poking at your tooth again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave it alone, it'll come out on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, either way, she's going to look like someone punched her lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She won't be able to smile, at the very least...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you grown taller again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You're going to do it, too, Daikichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starting to pick up a little excess weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough when you get older, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to nip it in the bud, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san's doing it like a boxer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is easier on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Teach me how to do that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No fair! How come only you get to look cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to learn to do it normally first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too! Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! You can do it backwards! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, is it really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:53.04,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Kids sure are amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They have so much energy, haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rock! Paper! Scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:11:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:11:00.22,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know where they get it from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, adults are pretty amazing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.31,0:11:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Adults?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you already know, but I'm not Rin's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We only started living together a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before that, I spent all of my time just thinking about myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but once I met her, my whole lifestyle changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys have been with your kids their whole lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm still pretty new to this, so it's not really a big deal yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but I'm wondering if it's really possible to deal with...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...never having any real alone time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.47,0:11:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.39,0:11:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin... Wasn't today the skipping competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I messed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How many skips did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's terri{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Two hundred and three!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can do that many?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.35,0:12:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that got you... first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's the certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You sure did well! This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.03,0:12:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I could've done way better on forward jumping...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you did only get one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're really good at it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know that, even if they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.54,0:12:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I lost weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are we almost there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm... About ten more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They'll want to see that wobbly tooth of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I keep telling you not to touch it unless you need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll show them my skipping, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've grown so much recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Mum and Dad are going to get a shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I'm taller than Auntie now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think you've grown {\i1}that{\i0} much...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have to go and fill Granddad in on things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Rin-chan! I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.14,0:14:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've grown so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you one of the the biggest in your class?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should have called! I would have come to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is capable of walking for ten minutes, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to be taller than me soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! Kazumi-oneechan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.17,0:14:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo. You're here early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I arrived a while before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They were yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Auntie sent them to me a while ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.06,0:14:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, let me see your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Two of the front teeth are wobbly just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? It doesn't hurt, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It hurts a little sometimes, but I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.53,0:14:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.95,0:14:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you do anything to help her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her gums are all red!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.37,0:14:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a little swelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, when I was younger, you said you'd pull mine out with thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:03.00,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,With thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My! I don't quite remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to make everything easy to chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Want some freeze-dried tofu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have some beans, too, Auntie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just eat up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I love freeze-dried tofu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.41,0:15:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did it fall out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blood! Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum! A tissue! A tissue!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.47,0:15:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.43,0:15:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, use this for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a dust cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan has changed so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe she's always been like that on the inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.61,0:16:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're getting married, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.95,0:16:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum told me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's nice. She said that he seemed like a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.66,0:16:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The only problem is that he wants kids straight away...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.63,0:16:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No going out drinking. No concerts.\NNo holidays. No good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't be able to do anything anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think you should be talking to him about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's not much I can say...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.39,0:16:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not even into kids to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I don't want to become one of those obnoxious mums!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I could sacrifice myself just to raise a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I think you'd make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you really wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess when the kid's already there, you don't really have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.33,0:17:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's easy for you to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.67,0:17:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what it's like to be a husband. Nor a father. Nor a mother, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I might not have time to go shopping or sit around drinking tea,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but my time at work is my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And my time with my son is my own, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All of it is precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think there's any special trick to being a parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heck, the world's full of people just like us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Granddad...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.59,0:18:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My adult teeth are starting to come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,T-This is sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say, "Cheese!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That vase...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san had one just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.95,0:19:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! The other one feels like it's going to come out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.14,0:20:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mirror! Mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that I'll go on fussing and worrying over the smallest things...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.78,0:20:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though that's probably true of all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.53,0:20:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.20,0:20:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.88,0:20:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck? You look like a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Send a text to your parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:44.76,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,A photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.22,0:20:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever else happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I'll go on being happy when I see her smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right! Open your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I think things are just fine like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.83,0:22:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
